# The Limitator in the regression room: the film camera round him in each hold, then first person.
# Tubes: limitator.
world room
camera 12 12 -999 0 0
light 13.5 12 3.2 1.4 9
light 9 8.5 3.2 0.9 8
# the third-person body is not drawn in a scene-only (environment inspection) frame
hud on
size 480 270
frames 720
